# Cache rules for files in public/, which Workers static assets serve with
# `max-age=0, must-revalidate` by default: a revalidation round trip per image
# on every visit, sixty of them for the turntable.
#
# A day, not a year. These names are not content-hashed, so `immutable` would
# be a promise the files cannot keep: re-running scripts/turntable-frames.swift
# or replacing a photo writes the same path, and a year-long cache would show
# the old one until it expired. After the day, stale-while-revalidate serves
# the cached copy at once and refreshes it in the background, so a returning
# visitor never waits on it and a changed file lands within one visit.
#
# The résumé PDF is left out on purpose: it is the file most likely to change
# and the one a recruiter must not get an old copy of.
#
# The /_next/static/* rule is the one the build writes into dist/client/ when
# public/ has no _headers of its own. With this file present it writes
# nothing, so the rule is repeated here: drop it and every hashed script,
# stylesheet and font silently goes back to revalidating on each visit.
#
# The /* rule is the static-asset half of next.config.ts's security headers.
# Cloudflare applies _headers only to files served from static assets, never
# to a response the Worker generates, and next.config.ts only to the Worker's
# responses, so without it every image, script and the PDF went out with
# neither. A request matching several rules inherits all of their headers (a
# header named twice would be comma-joined, so no two rules here share one).
# Keep the HSTS value in step with next.config.ts.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains
/_next/static/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
/turntable/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400, stale-while-revalidate=604800
/avatar*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400, stale-while-revalidate=604800
/portrait*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400, stale-while-revalidate=604800
/favicon.svg
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400, stale-while-revalidate=604800
